# The champion with the range-first target priority (prio 1): every
# kill-group sorts its engageable targets by the LONGEST enemy reach
# before convergence breaks ties (rw_bot.policy.firing, PRIO_RANGE), so
# a standing group turns on the artillery behind the line before the
# hover tanks in front of it. Measured only at Impossible (wwtac60,
# log 2026-09-08: -508 paired samples, zero wins anywhere, every
# tactical arm shorter) and never at Very Hard, where the loss-table anatomy of
# pinbase48 (log 2026-09-13) names the opener as the seed on which the
# enemy fields three to twelve c_artillery, zero on every winning seed.
# The cheapest form of the artillery-screening capability: not a new
# verb, the existing allele aimed at the population that has the gun.
# Every other knob and every goals slot is the champion's exactly.
name evolve1-g4m2-prange
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
